docs {
  # POST /api/v1/ai/widget

  Per-widget AI explainer. Returns a short answer about a given dashboard widget.
  Live LLM when configured, else scripted.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/ai/widget/route.ts`
  **Auth:** none at the route.

  ## Request body
  | field | values |
  |---|---|
  | widget | score · map · actors · leadership · articles · keywords |
  | mode | explain · drivers · talking |

  ## Response (200)
  ```json
  { "answer": "Indeks 6.4/10 (Krisis) mencerminkan 23 dari 128 artikel berstatus krisis tinggi..." }
  ```
}
